 and medial to the biopsy cavity  and 1 0cm from the nearest margin  inferior   Sections of this lesion are in G and H  A representative section of unremarkable tissue is in I  The axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes which are submitted in J Q  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Ashby Carter Moncure  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Moderate_(grade_II).
