emarkable fibroadipose tissue  Three sections in F H represent random samplings of this fibroadipose tissue  Representative section of the previously biopsied site is found in I  The axillary tail of the breast measures 11 x 6 x 1 5cm and is composed of fibroadipose tissue and accompanying fat replaced lymph nodes  which are included in cassettes J L  A second skin ellipse with underlying subcutaneous tissue  measuring 23 x 5 x 1 5cm was included with the specimen  The overlying skin is unremarkable and there is no palpable abnormality in the underlying subcutaneous tissue  Representative sections in M  N and O  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
