or aspect of the nipple there is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm well circumscribed pink to red area  The anterior aspect is inked blue and the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm cavity in the lateral breast  The lining is gray white  smooth glistening and fibrotic  There is a gray white fibrotic linear tract extending to the anterior margin in this area  The cavity comes to 2 0cm from the black inked posterior margin  The remaining surrounding parenchyma consists of dense pink to white lobulated fibrous tissue with multiple cysts  Posteroinferior to the biopsy cavity  the fibrous tissue has an area of accentuated lobulation but no distinct mass is identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Radial section of nipple with red area  B  Posterior margin closest to cavity  C F  Entire cavity to lateral anterior aspect  G P  Representative sections of posterior lower outer quadrant  inferior to cavity  Q R  Representative sections of uninvolved parenchyma along medial breast  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
