nd precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  12 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 18 26 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm oriented breast lumpectomy specimen with a long stitch designating lateral and a short stitch designating superior aspect of the specimen  The specimen is inked anteriorly black  posteriorly blue  superiorly green  and inferiorly red including the medial and lateral parts  Serial sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm white  firm  stellate mass  coming to within 0 5cm from the closest posterior margin  blue   1 0cm from the anterior  black  margin  The remainder of margins are at least 1 0cm away from tumor  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE A  Representative section of tumor  frozen as FX 1 B  Tumor to the closest posterior margin  blue  C  Tumor to the closest anterior resection margin  black  D  Tumor to posterior inferior  blue and red  E  Tumor to superior and posterior  green and blue  F  Uninvolved medial margin  en face G  Uninvolved lateral margin  en face Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right axillary sentinel node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm lymph node with attached adipose tissue  The lymph node is bisected and entirely frozen as FX 2  now as H  The remainder of fibroadipose is entirely submitted in cassette I  Resident  LAN WANG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA AND DCIS  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  LYMPH NODE  AXILLARY SENTINEL  RIGHT  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPO