s predominantly tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  There are also two rubbery to slightly indurated well circumscribed nodules which are discontinuous with the dense fibrotic aforementioned area and are located along the lateral superior aspect  2 0cm apart  Nodule  1 measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm abuts the superior aspect of the anterior blue inked margin and comes to 1 5cm from the closest posterior margin  Nodule  2 measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  comes to 1 0cm from the superior aspect of the anterior blue inked soft tissue margin and 1 2cm from the closest posterior resection margin  No obvious masses are identified  The specimen is serially sectioned from lateral to medial into 15 slices at 0 3cm in thickness  Representative sections of each slice are submitted sequentially from lateral to medial as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section to include deep margin from slice  1   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section to include posterior margin from slice  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section to include anterior and posterior margin from slice  3   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section to anterior and closest posterior margin from slice  4   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section with corresponding deep margin from slice  5   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section with deep margin from slice  6   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Slice  7 complete cross section entirely submitted from inferior to superior with the possible biopsy cavity in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and nodule  1 entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section corresponding posterior margin from slice  8 to include the possible remaining portion of the previous biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section corresponding overlying deep margin from slice  9   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section to include anterior and posterior margins f