ATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axilla sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm piece of yellow soft tissue  containing two probable lymph nodes  which are frozen as FX 1 and FX 1A  now resubmitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  One additional lymph node is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  1A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY BUT AWAIT CYTOKERATIN  Gross Dictation by Colleen A Lamb M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Colleen A Lamb M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  SKIN  LEFT MASTECTOMY FLAP   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   SENTINEL    EXCISION PART D  CRYOSTAT FROZEN SECTION  SLIDE ONLY  , Poor_(grade_III).
