 fibrous tissue are focal areas of induration  with no residual tumor grossly identified  Also noted is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm second cavity  2 5cm superio medial to the first cavity  It comes to 0 4cm from the deep and superficial margins and is surrounded by dense gray white fibrosis and fat necrosis  Residual tumor is not identified  The remaining cut surface is 40  dense gray white fibrous tissue and 60  tan yellow lobular fibroadipose tissue with no other gross abnormalities  Evaluation of the axillary contents reveals multiple tan pink lymph nodes  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A C  First cavity with deep margin  D  Indurated focus surrounding first cavity with margin  E  Second cavity with deep margin  F G  Second cavity with superficial margin  H J  Lymph nodes  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  DI TIAN  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Sarah P Thayer  M D  Mark Philip Eisenberg  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Poor_(grade_III).
