e new inferior margin  The sutured side is inked black  the opposite blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable parenchyma with no discrete lesions  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes P Q  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  deep posterior margin suture on true margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fragment of breast parenchyma with a suture on one aspect designating the deep posterior margin  The sutured side is inked black  the opposite blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal firm  white parenchyma with no discrete lesions  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes R T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  new medial margin suture on true margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a suture designating the new medial margin  The sutured aspect is inked black  the opposite blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable fatty parenchyma  The specimen has no discrete lesions and is submitted entirely in cassettes U V  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  new lateral margin suture on true margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a suture designating the new lateral margin  The sutured side is inked black  the opposite blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal firm  white  dense parenchyma  No discrete nodules are noted  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes W Z  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  axillary tissue right  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fragment of adipose tissue from which multiple lymph nodes  11  are identified  ranging from 0 2cm in greatest dimension to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  A representative section from each lymph node is submitted entirely in cassettes AA EE  Note that several of the lymph nodes have a firm  white  cut surface suggestive of metastatic carcinoma  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSES  1 AND  3  BREAST  BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  COMING TO WITHIN REMOVED_DATE CM OF THE INKED RESECTION MARGIN  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  SECOND SPECIMEN  BENIGN HYALINIZED NODULE WITH EXTENSIVE CALCIFICATION  O R  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  CALCIFICATIONS    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  NEW SUPERIOR    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART E  BREAST  RIGHT  NEW INFERIOR    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART F  BREAST  RIGHT  DEEP POSTERIOR    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART G  BREAST  RIGHT  NEW MEDIAL    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART H  BREAST  RIGHT  NEW LATERAL    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
