ssue is dissected to reveal multiple  firm  well circumscribed  lymph nodes that range in size from 0 2cm to 1 0cm  A frozen section is performed and the frozen tissue is saved frozen  SECTION CODE  A  area of dilated ducts which extend to the closest deep margin  relative to the closest deep margin B  area of dilated ducts with paste like intraluminal material closest to superior margin C D  representative section of dilated ducts with paste like material E G  representative sections of firm rubbery breast parenchyma  H  nearest deep resection margin from firm breast tissue I  representative sections of breast parenchyma J  representative section of nipple K Q  axillary lymph nodes R  breast parenchyma  0 5cm beneath the nipple S  dilated ducts with luminal paste like material  representative sections T  lateral aspect of dilated ducts with luminal paste like material U  representative section of nipple V  inferior skin margin closest to nipple with dilated ducts  0 2cm from margin  closest to mipple  en face  W  superior skin margin  closest to nipple  en face  X  medial skin margin Y  lateral skin margin Z  dilated ducts with paste like material  medial most extension of this area AA GG  Additonal sections of breast from areas of microcalcifications  Gross Description by  Dennis Sgroi  M D  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT AXILLARY CONTENTS    report_end  , Poor_(grade_III).
