picious  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  MARGIN OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  LOCATION OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  Within the region of the mass  GRADE OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  3 MARGIN OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   TABLE OF PATHOLOGICAL FINDINGS 2 INVASIVE LOBULAR CARCINOMA TUMOR SIZE  3 5cm  greatest span by gross examination  GRADE  2 LYMPHATIC VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  MARGIN OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   By his her signature below  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a 750 gram  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 3cm simple mastectomy specimen with 6 5cm in length possible axillary tail  There is an unremarkable pink tan REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm areola  and a grossly unremarkable REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm nipple  There is a 2 8cm healed linear horizontal scar extending from the 11 to1 o clock position 2 8cm from the nipple  There is also a REMOVED_DATE x 13cm ellipse of skin included in this specimen  The skin is smooth pale pink with three raised papules measuring 1 0cm  0 5cm and 0 2cm  located in the 9  3  and 12 o clock aspects of the specimen  with axillary tail used as lateral designation  The anterior resection surface is inked blue  posterior inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 1cm area of firm pale white tissue with areas of punctate hemorrhage  in the 10 o clock aspect of the specimen  3 5cm from posterior margin  and 2 6cm from the